Z_Rv2RtrA3aB8SHnVTC8J_JeazhySWq-BB0-eoyunjZvAMScCzFiutf5I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftPBCqMkpxzw-SgYo3tMyI3Va0MhuGRfIRZiawdQTsyZw&oe=699993A8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "1116681196788883", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982477_1116681200122216_6236613464184975156_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X54wxnnMvCsQ7kNvwHFpMjf&_nc_oc=AdnZ7kOxuI4ukX0KZ9nzMggu6Qcvocng-lNXTC5icLSTV_hTa7tIAGYZFWnLkQzTHIc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfurRtC33ku9hIeTD_JpZZ4LpiVdEvU6PjcWkaBHX-J3Cg&oe=6999B016"}, "display_name": "SprintAR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "SprintAR is an Augmented Reality training app.\n\nIt lays out different patterns of training cones for sprinting, football, soccer or basketball. Automatically records lap times and shows a **ghost replay for you to chase!**\n\n- Never measure out training cones (witches hats) ever again!\n- Never have to collect them back up again, either :)\n- Includes many different cone patterns (no need to research them)\n\n# For personal trainers and coaches\n\n- Impress students with the latest technology\n- When running, students see a guide where to go next\n- Forces students to go round cones properly\n- Optionally use soccer balls or basketballs\n- Designed to quickly hand off the headset from one student to the next\n\n# For students\n\n- Chase a ghost of the best time!\n- See your time instantly\n- Practice multiple patterns, in the same space, with no setup time\n\n**SAFETY WARNING: never expose the inside of your VR headset (where the lenses are) to direct sunlight**\n", "short_description": "Layout different patterns of training cones in Augmented Reality. Automatically record lap times and show a ghost replay for you to chase!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://kennardconsulting.com/sprintar/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_ser